  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"1.86.0\"\n  commit: 33cbf70dec4f64836a26dcb4a885cb09b7279dd3\n\npackage:\n  name: nn\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/sakov/nn-c/archive/${{ commit }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: eb00f951bbe36e933d16de520db44acf93e9becf6e0182e391c1c7f98441972b\n  patches:\n    # Backport of upstream nn-c commit 283e997 (in v2.0.10) to avoid pointer\n    # truncation on win-64, where unsigned long is 32 bit\n    - patches/changes-to-use-size_t-instead-of-unsigned-long-to-po.patch\n    - patches/use-the-c99-math-functions-of-the-msvc-runtime.patch\n    - patches/provide-gettimeofday-for-the-standalone-minell-with-.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 2004\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler(\"c\") }}\n    - ${{ stdlib(\"c\") }}\n    - if: unix\n      then:\n        - make\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - nnbathy -V\n  - package_contents:\n      bin:\n        - nnbathy\n        - minell\n      include:\n        - nn.h\n      lib:\n        - if: unix\n          then: libnn.a\n          else: nn.lib\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/sakov/nn-c\n  summary: Natural Neighbours interpolation.\n  # The bundled Triangle code (nn/triangle.c) is non-free for commercial use.\n  license: BSD-2-Clause AND LicenseRef-Triangle\n  license_file: nn/LICENSE\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - ocefpaf\n",
